128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this milestone, we focus on validating the functionality, reliability and performance of the APIs that drive the Digital Solution for Senior Citizens platform. The goal of this project is to provide senior citizens with an accessible, user-friendly digital experience to overcome various challenges they face in daily life. To ensure the platform operates smoothly and meets its intended goals, extensive testing of its APIs is necessary.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We have carefully designed test cases for 7 key APIs, each designed to handle different aspects of the platform's functionality. The test cases are structured to validate API responses, ensuring that the inputs, expected outputs and actual outputs are consistent, ensure the other functionalities, for eg. integration with GenAI functions as intended. Furthermore, unit tests were written using pytest to automate testing and improve the overall development process.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4 5 6 7]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
